        "finding": "Noma Security AgentSmith (CVSS 8.8) described a Prompt Hub malicious-proxy issue that could intercept secrets from users who ran a malicious agent. LangSmith implemented a backend fix on 2024-11-06. No evidence of a current unresolved LangSmith Cloud platform compromise was found.",
